3e_text","label":"ggpz5A2eo3e_text","default":"<p>Yes — the trainer is symmetrical and works equally well for left- and right-handed golfers. The grip and spring mechanism function the same way regardless of your dominant hand.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggB9gWrFLRt_text","label":"ggB9gWrFLRt_text","default":"<p>Every order includes the Pro Swing Click Trainer rod (extends from 38.5cm to 65cm) and the elbow corrector arm band. Together they target the two most common swing faults: early release and chicken wing. No extra purchases needed.</p>"}],
